    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d384-a1">

                <pb facs="1440" n="1282" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1282"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Vice-Gonsal to
                        Ambassador Meyer</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Warsaw</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-10-11"><hi rendition="#italic">October 11,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm my yesterday’s
                    wire, running thus:</p>
                <p>“Lodz general strike owing (to the) execution (of) five terrorists.”</p>
                <p>The strike, which was extended to Zgierz and Pabjanice, in vicinity of Lodz, was
                    of demonstrative character and is not likely to hold on.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Witold Fuchs.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
